{"q":{"g":"In this quest you need to pick up and extract with an MBT Integrated Navigation System. It can be found inside a locked room in the bigger of the two garage buildings at the repair center (white knight) on Reserve. A RB-ST key is required to open the door. The item can be found inside a wooden crate in the back left of the room.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/e/e8/SurplusGoodsGarageMap.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230605002547","c":"Garage marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/6/60/SurplusGoodsGarage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260424184251","c":"The wanted garage"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/6/67/RB-ST_door_inside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20250716002241","c":"The locked door"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/e/e2/Surplus_goods_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230528235305","c":"Pile of crates"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/0/07/Surplus_goods_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230528235342","c":"The wanted crate"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/9/9d/Surplusitem.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230528235416","c":"Close up of the item inside the crate"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/1/16/MBT_NC_tarkov_quest_item_small.png/revision/latest?cb=20221012074313","c":""}]},"o":{},"x":{}}